XADD <stream-name> <id> field1 value1 field2 value2 ...

<stream-name> → Name of the stream.
<id> → Entry ID.
* → Auto-generate ID.
milliseconds-sequence → Custom ID.
field value → Key-value pairs stored in the entry.


Example:
	XADD order-stream * orderId 1001 customer John amount 250
	

order-stream
|
+-- 1750256712345-0
      orderId = 1001
      customer = John
      amount = 250


Insert Another Event:
		XADD order-stream * orderId 1002 customer David amount 500
		
Read all events
	XRANGE order-stream - +		
	
	1) 1750256712345-0
	   orderId
	   1001
	   customer
	   John
	   amount
	   250

	2) 1750256715000-0
	   orderId
	   1002
	   customer
	   David
	   amount
	   500
Get Particular Stream Data:
XRANGE order-stream 1750256712345-0 1750256712345-0

	   
Specify your own ID
XADD order-stream 1000-1 orderId 1003 customer Alex amount 700


Add JSON as a field
XADD payment-stream * payload \
'{"paymentId":"P100","status":"SUCCESS","amount":1000}'

	   
